        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 4820bottom, Baden Entry Door Handleset Lower Half Only</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is the bottom half of the Emtek <a href=\"/products/baden-handleset-emtek-4820\">Baden Handleset</a>. Pair with an electronic deadbolt such as the <a href=\"/products/emtouch-modern-electronic-keypad-deadbolt-emtek-e3020\">Emtek EMTOUCH</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Baden Entrance Handleset No Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 1-7/8”</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Height: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 8-5/8\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-4820-bottom-specifications.pdf?v=1704262437\"><b>Emtek 4820bottom Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
